  "title": "Black Diamond Spot 400-R Rechargeable Headlamp",
  "handle": "black-diamond-spot-400-r-rechargeable-headlamp",
  "description": "<p>Designed for those who push their limits, the Black Diamond Spot 400-R is a rechargeable headlamp that combines power, durability, and sustainability. Its 400-lumen beam provides bright, clear illumination, while PowerTap technology allows instant switching between full brightness and dimmed settings. The built-in BD 1500 Li-ion battery offers reliable performance and charges easily via micro-USB. </p>\n<p>An ergonomic, low-profile design ensures a comfortable fit, while the waterproof IP67 rating means it functions even after submersion. The Spot 400-R also features a recycled elastic headband, making it a more sustainable choice for outdoor enthusiasts.</p>\n<p>Light Values:</p>\n<p><strong>Power Mode</strong><br>Light output: 400 lm<br>Light distance: 100 m<br>Run time: 4 hours</p>\n<p><strong>Medium Mode</strong><br>Light output: 200 lm<br>Light distance: 60 m<br>Run time: 8 hours</p>\n<p><strong>Low Power Mode</strong><br>Light output: 6 lm<br>Light distance: 12 m<br>Run time: 225 hours</p>",
